TITLE:: DualProcessTracker
summary:: A tracker that combines fast, reactive tracking with slow, predictive modeling.
categories:: Analysis, Pitch
related:: Classes/MultiF0Tracker, Classes/PerceptualModel

DESCRIPTION::
DualProcessTracker implements a "Dual Process" architecture for pitch tracking, inspired by cognitive psychology (System 1 and System 2).

LIST::
## STRONG::Fast Process (System 1)::: Reactive, low-latency tracking using YIN or spectral peak-picking. It is prone to errors but provides immediate feedback.
## STRONG::Slow Process (System 2)::: Predictive, high-latency modeling using Bayesian updates and historical context. It corrects the errors of the Fast Process and maintains track continuity through noise.
::

